# LS CRUDE

- Prices come from Yahoo Finance `CL=F`. Do not scrape Investing.com for OHLCV.
- In-sample is 2015-01-01 to 2023-12-31. Out-sample starts 2024-01-01 and is opened once.
- Investing.com CSV is the news source of record. Yahoo news is a fallback.
- Oil Slice is the pizza-index spoon: `2 * hormuz + 1 * inflation_policy`.
- Route modules export `loader`, `action`, and `meta`. Import `Route` from `./+types/...`. Use `loaderData` / `actionData` props, never `useLoaderData` or `useActionData`.
- Import UI from local shadcn-style modules, not Radix. Import router APIs from `react-router`.
- Read `.cursor/skills/` before generating pipeline or dashboard code.
- Research dumps go to `research/gathering/raw/` (gitignored). Curated notes go to `research/gathering/notes/`. Source rows go to `research/gathering/sources/REGISTRY.md`. Promote to `docs/experiments/` only after `research/INTAKE.md` checks. Do not invent performance numbers. Leave `pizza-hunt.md` empty when there is no real candidate.
